<title>USA: Bull Run Corp to buy back 2 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Bull Run Corp to buy back 2 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bull Run Corp said Wednesday that its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to 2,000,000 shares of the its common stock over the next year.</p>
<p>The company said the repurchases may be made from time to time in the open market or directly from shareholders at prevailing market prices, and may be discontinued at any time.</p>
<p>Over the past two years, the company said it has repurchased 1,171,510 shares under a previous stock repurchase program, at an average cost of $2.53 per share.</p>
</text>
